And now things become more subtle.

Moon — the creative power
Sixth:

Soma.

The Moon.

And here, the associated result is:

Sṛṣṭi-sāmarthya.

The capacity to manifest or create.

Now, remember our discussions of the Moon in relation to apāna, the lunar movement of vital energy and the powers of manifestation.

The lunar principle has a deep role in this subtle-body cosmology.

And here it’s associated with the capacity for creation.

Not simply the astronomical Moon being beautiful in the sky.

The divine power expressed through its lunar form.

