External and internal.

And the internal kind is particularly interesting.

6. External bathing — how to wash yourself in Śiva
Right.

We’ve got:

Bāhya-sn āna — external bathing.

And:

Ābhyantara-snāna — internal bathing.

Let’s begin with external bathing.

